    "body": "STOPPED before claim: the required base for part 3 is not available.\n\nIssue #2790 requires part 2, #2789, first. Issue #2789 has no PR yet. Part 1, branch `issue/917-solidcore-step`, also has no open PR.\n\nAt upstream/main 744c0847b04d54cfc6e3e8b24a21520c40b6bcef, `crates/app/Cargo.toml` still directly depends on `truck-stepio` and `ruststep`. Removing the workspace dependencies now would break the app.\n\nThe latest plan on #917 requires the three parts to run one at a time. Resume #2790 after the earlier parts have their gates and the part 2 base is available. No claim, worktree, or code change was made.\n",
